DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260810T180000
SUMMARY:C&O Hike Finale to Washington DC
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for a 15 mile final hike in the C&O Canal series\, then to Washing
 ton DC and the capital at the end by walking the National Mall.\nThis is a
 lso part of our 911 National Memorial Trail series. After this hike\, we v
 isit the Pentagon\, and make our way back northeast.\nIf needed contact me
  at 908 343 8374
