DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260816T180000
SUMMARY:Black Rock Schuylkill Loop Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this awesome loop hike featuring not only the Schuylkill River
  Trail\, but also the Black Rock Sanctuary and much more.\nWe meet at 9\, 
 at Craig's Cat Cafe in Spring City.\nThe trip will include walking three a
 lmost loops within the sanctuary covering just about all of the trails the
 re. We will continue to the south and then reach the Schuylkill River Trai
 l. We will follow this to the north\, then make our way around to the Roye
 rsford crossing.\n\nDistance will be about 15 miles. If needed\, contact m
 e at 908 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/313400892/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260217T185645Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260217T185645Z
